@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontColor #000000
hide circle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 0
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam ArrowColor #000000
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classBorderColor #000000
skinparam classFontColor #000000
skinparam stereotypeFontColor #000000
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam noteBorderColor #000000
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontSize 24
skinparam titleFontColor #000000
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam packageBorderColor #000000
hide empty members
title Strategy - interchangeable pricing rules
left to right direction
class PricingCalculator <<context>> {
  + calculate(lines, fulfillment, strategy) : Pricing
}
interface DiscountStrategy <<strategy>> {
  + code() : String
  + discount(subtotal, fulfillment) : BigDecimal
}
class NoDiscount <<concrete strategy>> {
  + discount(...) : BigDecimal
}
class StudentDiscount <<concrete strategy>> {
  + discount(...) : BigDecimal
}
class PickupDiscount <<concrete strategy>> {
  + discount(...) : BigDecimal
}
class FamilyDiscount <<concrete strategy>> {
  + discount(...) : BigDecimal
}
class DiscountCatalog <<registry>> {
  + find(code) : DiscountStrategy
}
class Pricing <<record>> {
  + subtotal() : BigDecimal
  + discount() : BigDecimal
  + total() : BigDecimal
  + currency() : String
}
PricingCalculator ..> DiscountStrategy : accepts and delegates
DiscountStrategy <|.. NoDiscount
DiscountStrategy <|.. StudentDiscount
DiscountStrategy <|.. PickupDiscount
DiscountStrategy <|.. FamilyDiscount
DiscountCatalog --> DiscountStrategy : looks up by code
PricingCalculator ..> Pricing : returns
note bottom of PickupDiscount
NONE: no discount; STUDENT: 10%.
PICKUP: 20%, valid only for TAKEAWAY.
FAMILY: 15%, subtotal at least 6000 KZT.
Invalid eligibility fails explicitly.
end note
note bottom of PricingCalculator
BigDecimal, scale 2, HALF_UP.
A strategy is supplied per calculation.
end note
@enduml
